Negative control for useContract.actions.ts `onDone` (R37 B9).

Spec that must flip: contract.manager-members.int.test.ts
("When my payment-method change finishes I am told it is done",
contract.feature:329) — awaits `useActions().onDone()` across a
payment-method write and expects it to resolve true only once that write
finishes, never while the form is idle.

Mutation: keeps the `onDone` member but resolves true at once, without
waiting for a write to leave `changingPaymentMethod.processing`.

